  p=0.01: BP=1.000e-4  BP+OSD=2.500e-5  relay-BP=0.000e0±0e0  (relay inf× better than BP+OSD)
  p=0.02: BP=6.500e-4  BP+OSD=2.500e-4  relay-BP=7.500e-5±8e-5  (relay 3.33× better than BP+OSD)
  p=0.03: BP=4.775e-3  BP+OSD=2.675e-3  relay-BP=2.125e-3±5e-4  (relay 1.26× better than BP+OSD)
  p=0.04: BP=2.038e-2  BP+OSD=1.300e-2  relay-BP=1.230e-2±1e-3  (relay 1.06× better than BP+OSD)
  p=0.05: BP=6.057e-2  BP+OSD=4.172e-2  relay-BP=4.473e-2±2e-3  (relay 0.93× better than BP+OSD)
